r orthotopic liver transplantation (OLT)</article-title><source>Am J Transplant</source><year>2005</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>1120</fpage><lpage>1129</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15816895</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1600-6143.2005.00852.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jamal</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ghannoum</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Naud</surname><given-names>J-F</given-names></name><name><surname>Turgeon</surname><given-names>P-P</given-names></name><name><surname>Leblanc</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Permanent renal failure induced by pentastarch</article-title><source>NDT Plus</source><year>2008</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>322</fpage><lpage>325</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/ndtplus/sfn075</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perel</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Colloids versus crystalloids for fluid resuscitation in critically ill patients</article-title><source>Cochrane Database Syst Rev</source><year>2007</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>CD000567</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17943746</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>